docs/research/2026-10-29-ledger-standard/current-state.before-closeout-2026-10-30.md:19:**2026-10-29 night (7): the extraction standard is signed (D243) and the golden set fixed.** [`docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html`](../../prd/05-extraction-standard.html), version 3, replaces the first version (D229) as the one ruler for extraction. Alex decided proposal 5 stricter than its lean (a typical claim or background line, common knowledge to an analyst following the company, is not kept without a number and a specific narrative) and the other eleven at their leans; his direction: lean cautious, catch the increment. The golden set is `research/2026-10-29-ledger-standard/golden-v3/golden-v3-signed.json` (sha256 78844bc3…; 348 entries to keep or optionally keep, 738 sentences not kept and 24 optional, every span verbatim), fixed by `finalize.py` with 39 reasoned changes (24 common-knowledge claims removed under proposal 5, 19 entries that were kept and rejected at once settled). The fiscal-year defect in the year limit is fixed with a test (2 of 40 stored candidates had been refused). AGENTS.md (§6, §7, §8) and both READMEs carry the signed state. Nothing committed.
